        "speaker": "Mum",
        "text": "I think it will rain this afternoon.",
        "es": "Creo que va a llover esta tarde."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "text": "Then I'll take an umbrella.",
        "es": "Entonces llevo un paraguas."
      }
